Template: vibecoder/initial-admin-id
Type: string
Default:
Description: Initial vibecoder administrator identifier (optional):
 This is a non-secret logical identifier used only for attribution and audit.
 Local authorization continues to require root. Leave it empty to create the
 identity later with "vibecoder-admin setup init".

Template: vibecoder/show-first-run-hint
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Show first-run configuration instructions?
 The package remains inert after installation. No inference, GitHub write or
 remote operation is enabled until an administrator explicitly completes and
 activates the configuration.
